<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 266 0 R
/E (For this project, I conducted basic user interviews and online surveys with both students and potential investors to understand their loan-related challenges. Initially, I assumed that students mainly struggled with documentation, but the research revealed that trust, transparency, and response time were bigger concerns. I also assumed investors only cared about profit, but findings showed they also wanted a secure platform and clear repayment tracking. These insights helped refine the app features to focus more on trust, security, and a simplified loan process.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
